<span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="float:none">We’re excited to advise that your Classic Reward seats in booking reference&nbsp;{{{Case.Booking_PNR__c}}} are confirmed and ready for ticketing. We understand that you may have other plans to finalise and we’re happy to hold the seats for you until 5pm on </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:#e74c3c;"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="float:none">(insert date – 5 days from today)</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style="color:black"><span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="float:none">. After this time the booking will be cancelled. </span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="color:black">Please contact the VIP Service Team when you're ready to secure this journey with us.<br />
<br style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
<span style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start"><span style="text-decoration-thickness:initial"><span style="text-decoration-style:initial"><span style="text-decoration-color:initial"><span style="float:none">Kind Regards,</span></span></span></span></span><br />
<br style="font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-thickness:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; text-decoration-color:initial" />
